## Container Deployment

### Docker Image

**1. Build Image:**
```bash
# Build with default settings
docker build -t {{.ProjectName | lower}}:latest .

# Build with specific version
docker build -t {{.ProjectName | lower}}:v1.0.0 .

# Multi-platform build
docker buildx build --platform linux/amd64,linux/arm64 \
  -t {{.ProjectName | lower}}:latest .
```

**2. Image Optimization:**
```dockerfile
# Multi-stage build for minimal image size
FROM golang:{{.GoVersion}}-alpine AS builder
# ... build steps ...

FROM alpine:latest
RUN apk --no-cache add ca-certificates tzdata
# ... runtime setup ...
```

**3. Run Container:**
```bash
# Basic run
docker run -p {{.GrpcPort | default 50051}}:{{.GrpcPort | default 50051}} {{.ProjectName | lower}}:latest

# With environment variables
docker run \
  -e GRPC_PORT={{.GrpcPort | default 50051}} \
  -e LOG_LEVEL=info \
  {{- if ne .DatabaseDriver ""}}
  -e DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@host:5432/db \
  {{- end}}
  -p {{.GrpcPort | default 50051}}:{{.GrpcPort | default 50051}} \
  {{.ProjectName | lower}}:latest

# With volume mounts
docker run \
  -v $(pwd)/configs:/app/configs:ro \
  -v $(pwd)/certs:/app/certs:ro \
  -p {{.GrpcPort | default 50051}}:{{.GrpcPort | default 50051}} \
  {{.ProjectName | lower}}:latest
```

### Container Registry

