## Load Balancing

### gRPC Load Balancing

**1. Client-Side Load Balancing:**
```go
// Go client with load balancing
conn, err := grpc.Dial(
    "dns:///{{.ProjectName | lower}}.default.svc.cluster.local:{{.GrpcPort | default 50051}}",
    grpc.WithDefaultServiceConfig(`{
        "loadBalancingPolicy": "round_robin",
        "healthCheckConfig": {
            "serviceName": "{{.ProjectName | lower}}.v1.{{.ProjectName}}Service"
        }
    }`),
)
```

**2. Nginx Load Balancer:**
```nginx
upstream {{.ProjectName | lower}}_backend {
    server {{.ProjectName | lower}}-1:{{.GrpcPort | default 50051}};
    server {{.ProjectName | lower}}-2:{{.GrpcPort | default 50051}};
    server {{.ProjectName | lower}}-3:{{.GrpcPort | default 50051}};
}

server {
    listen {{.GrpcPort | default 50051}} http2;
    
    location / {
        grpc_pass grpc://{{.ProjectName | lower}}_backend;
        grpc_set_header Host $host;
    }
}
```

**3. HAProxy Load Balancer:**
```
backend {{.ProjectName | lower}}_backend
    mode tcp
    balance roundrobin
    option tcp-check
    server {{.ProjectName | lower}}-1 {{.ProjectName | lower}}-1:{{.GrpcPort | default 50051}} check
    server {{.ProjectName | lower}}-2 {{.ProjectName | lower}}-2:{{.GrpcPort | default 50051}} check
    server {{.ProjectName | lower}}-3 {{.ProjectName | lower}}-3:{{.GrpcPort | default 50051}} check

frontend {{.ProjectName | lower}}_frontend
    bind *:{{.GrpcPort | default 50051}}
    mode tcp
    default_backend {{.ProjectName | lower}}_backend
```

